    "body": "I believe there's quite a mix on that front. I checked 5 cases at \"random\" before getting bored. Dictionaries first:\r\n* https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#extensions-to-the-window-interface\r\n* https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-textdecoder\r\nDictionaries last:\r\n* https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-eventtarget\r\n* https://wicg.github.io/background-fetch/#background-fetch-manager\r\n* https://w3c.github.io/sensors/#the-sensor-interface\r\n\r\nI'll go with Dave's suggested order here since it reads fine to me.",
